<doc id="187792" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=187792" title="Sochi">
Sochi

Sochi (&lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;: Со́чи,]) iku &lt;a href="kutha%20resor"&gt;kutha resor&lt;/a&gt; paling gedhé ing &lt;a href="Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha iki dumunung ing &lt;a href="Sochi%20%28kali%29"&gt;Kali Sochi&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Sagara%20Ireng"&gt;Sagara Ireng&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Rusia%20Kidul"&gt;Rusia Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi populasi 443.562 jiwa, nganti 600.000 pendhudhuk ing wilayah kutha. Kutha iki jembaré 176,77 km2, nalika Area Greater Sochi nyakup 3502 km2. Sochi ngliwati 145 km, lan kutha paling dawa ing &lt;a href="Eropa"&gt;Eropa&lt;/a&gt;, kutha paling gedhe nomer lima ing &lt;a href="Distrik%20Federal%20Kidul"&gt;Distrik Federal Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, kutha paling gedhe nomer loro ing &lt;a href="Krasnodar%20Krai"&gt;Krasnodar Krai&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sagara%20Ireng%23Population"&gt;kutha paling gedhe nomer enem&lt;/a&gt; ing Sagara Ireng.
Minangka bagéan saka &lt;a href="Caucasian%20Riviera"&gt;Caucasian Riviera&lt;/a&gt;, iku salah siji saka sawetara panggonan ing Rusia karo iklim &lt;a href="subtropis"&gt;subtropis&lt;/a&gt;, karo panas anget kanggo panas lan mangsa entheng kanggo adhem.
Sochi dadi tuan rumah &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin%202014"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Dingin XXII&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Paralimpiade%20Musim%20Dingin%202014"&gt;Olimpiade Musim Dingin Paralimpik XI&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2014. Iki dadi tuan rumah acara Olimpiade Alpine lan Nordic ing resor ski cedhak &lt;a href="Rosa%20Khutor%20Alpine%5D%20Resort"&gt;Rosa Khutor&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Krasnaya%20Polyana%2C%20Sochi%2C%20Krasnodar%20Krai"&gt;Krasnaya Polyana&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga dadi tuan rumah Formula 1 &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20Rusia"&gt;Grand Prix Rusia&lt;/a&gt; wiwit 2014 nganti 2021. Kutha iki uga dadi salah sawijining kutha tuan rumah kanggo &lt;a href="Piala%20Dunia%20FIFA%202018"&gt;Piala Dunia FIFA 2018&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Etimologi</h2>
Etimologi.
Konsensus umum (uga diakoni dening situs web kutha dhewe) yaiku jeneng "Sochi" (&lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Сочи) minangka wangun Russified saka &lt;a href="basa%20Sircassian"&gt;Circassian&lt;/a&gt; "Ş̂açə" () sing asalé saka &lt;a href="basa%20Ubykh"&gt;Ubykh-Circassian&lt;/a&gt;, asalé saka jeneng Ubykh "Ş̂uaça" (). Iku &lt;a href="Senyawa%20%28linguistik%29"&gt;senyawa&lt;/a&gt; digawe munggah saka rong tembung Ubykh "шъуа" (sagara) lan "ча" (sisih) lan kira-kira nerjemahake menyang "Seaside / pesisir". Ana pratelan lan teori liyane, miturut sumber Georgian., tembung iki asalé saka tembung Georgia kanggo "fir", "soch'i" (#ALIH).
<h2>Riwayat</h2>
Artikel utama: &lt;a href="Sajarah%20Sochi"&gt;Sajarah Sochi&lt;/a&gt;
<h3>Riwayat Awal</h3>
Riwayat.
Riwayat Awal.
Sadurungé wilayah kabèh ditaklukaké déning &lt;a href="Cimmerian"&gt;Cimmerian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scythian"&gt;Scythian&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sarmatian"&gt;Sarmatian&lt;/a&gt; penjajah, wong &lt;a href="Zygii"&gt;Zygii&lt;/a&gt; (Proto-&lt;a href="Circassians"&gt;Adyghe&lt;/a&gt;) manggon ing &lt;a href="Abkhazia%20Kecil"&gt;Abkhazia Kecil&lt;/a&gt;] ing &lt;a href="Karajaan%20Pontus"&gt;Karajaan Pontus&lt;/a&gt;, banjur pengaruh &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Romawi"&gt;Kakaisaran Romawi&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="kuno%20klasik"&gt;kuno&lt;/a&gt;. Saka abad kaping 6 nganti abad kaping 11, wilayah kasebut terus-terusan dadi krajan Georgia &lt;a href="Lazica"&gt;Lazica&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Karajaan%20Abkhazia"&gt;Abkhazia&lt;/a&gt;, sing mbangun puluhan gréja ing wates kutha, sing banjur dadi &lt;a href="Karajaan%20Abkhazia%5D%20Georgia%23Unification%20of%20the%20Georgian%20State"&gt;unified&lt;/a&gt; ing sangisoré &lt;a href="Kingdom%20of%20Georgia"&gt;Monarki Georgia&lt;/a&gt; ing abad kaping-11, mbentuk salah siji saka &lt;a href="Saeristavo"&gt;Saeristavo&lt;/a&gt;, sing dikenal minangka &lt;a href="Kadipaten%20Tskhumi"&gt;Tskhumi&lt;/a&gt; ngluwihi kagungane nganti &lt;a href="Nicopsis"&gt;Nicopsis&lt;/a&gt;. Pemukiman Kristen ing pinggir pesisir dirusak dening &lt;a href="Alans"&gt;Alans&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Khazars"&gt;Khazars&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Mongol"&gt;Mongol&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kekaisaran%20nomad"&gt;kekaisaran nomad&lt;/a&gt; liyane sing kontrol wilayah kasebut sithik. Tembok sisih lor abad kaping 11 &lt;a href="arsitektur%20Bizantium"&gt;Byzantine&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="basilica"&gt;basilica&lt;/a&gt; isih ana ing &lt;a href="Loo%20Microdistrict"&gt;Loo Microdistrict&lt;/a&gt;.
Antarane &lt;a href="abad%20kaping%2013"&gt;abad kaping 13&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="abad%20kaping%2015"&gt;abad kaping 15&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Republik%20Genoa"&gt;Republik Genoa&lt;/a&gt; duweni monopoli perdagangan ing pesisir Sagara Ireng, lan nggawe koloni lan pos dagang ing wilayah Sochi saiki, sing paling gedhe yaiku &lt;a href="Adler%20Microdistrict"&gt;Layso&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Khosta%20Microdistrict"&gt;Costa&lt;/a&gt;.
Saka abad kaping 14 nganti abad kaping 19, wilayah iki didominasi suku &lt;a href="wong%20Abkhaz"&gt;Abkhaz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="wong%20Ubykh"&gt;Ubykh&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="wong%20Adyghe"&gt;Adyghe&lt;/a&gt;, panggonan saiki kutha Sochi. (Ş̂açə) sing dikenal minangka &lt;a href="Ubykhia"&gt;Ubykhia&lt;/a&gt; minangka bagéan saka sajarah &lt;a href="Circassia"&gt;Circassia&lt;/a&gt;, lan dikuwasani déning wong pribumi klan pendaki gunung lokal Kaukasus sisih lor-kulon, nominal ing sangisoré kedaulatan &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Ottoman"&gt;Kakaisaran Ottoman&lt;/a&gt;, sing dadi mitra dagang utama ing jagad Islam.
<h3>Kakaisaran Rusia</h3>
Kakaisaran Rusia.
Garis pantai iki dipasrahake marang &lt;a href="Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1829 minangka akibat saka &lt;a href="Perang%20Rusia-Circassian"&gt;Perang Rusia-Circassian&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Perang%20Rusia-Turki%20%281828%E2%80%931829%29"&gt;Perang Rusia-Turki&lt;/a&gt;, 1828–1829; nanging &lt;a href="Circassians"&gt;Circassians&lt;/a&gt; ora nampa kontrol Rusia ing &lt;a href="Circassia"&gt;Circassia&lt;/a&gt; lan tetep nglawan pos-pos Rusia sing mentas diadegaké ing sadawane &lt;a href="pansisir%20Sirkassia"&gt;pansisir Sirkassia&lt;/a&gt; (). Penyediaan senjata lan amunisi saka luar negeri menyang Circassians nyebabake konflik diplomatik antarane [[Kakaisaran Rusia|Kakaisaran Rusia]] lan &lt;a href="Abad%20Kekaisaran%20Inggris"&gt;Kakaisaran Inggris&lt;/a&gt; sing dumadi abang ing taun 1836 liwat &lt;a href="misi%20Vixen"&gt;misi Vixen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;ref&gt;&lt;a href="Peter%20Hopkirk"&gt;Peter Hopkirk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https%3A//books.google.com/books%3Fid%3D1_41VGoCYU8C%26amp%3Bpg%3DPA158"&gt;The great game: On Secret Service in High Asia&lt;/a&gt;, Bab 12 "The Greatest Fortress in the World", pp. 158–159, Oxford University Press, 2001 &lt;a href="International%20Standard%20Book%20Number"&gt;ISBN&lt;/a&gt; Ing taun 1838, bèntèng Alexandria, sing dijenengi Navaginsky setaun sakbanjuré, didegaké ing muara &lt;a href="Kali%20Sochi"&gt;Kali Sochi&lt;/a&gt; minangka bagéan saka garis pesisir Sagara Ireng, rantai pitulas. bètèng-bètèng diatur kanggo nglindhungi wilayah saka resistance Circassian bola-bali. Nalika pecah &lt;a href="Perang%20Krimea"&gt;Perang Krimea&lt;/a&gt;, garnisun dievakuasi saka Navaginsky supaya ora dicekel déning wong Turki, sing banjur ndharat ing &lt;a href="Adler%2C%20Rusia"&gt;Cape Adler&lt;/a&gt;.
Perang pungkasan ing &lt;a href="Perang%20Russo-Circassian"&gt;Perang Russo-Circassian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Perang%20Qbaada"&gt;Perang Qbaada&lt;/a&gt;, dumadi ing taun 1864 lan bèntèng Dakhovsky diadegaké ing panggonan bèntèng Navaginsky. Pungkasane Perang Kaukasia diproklamasikake ing Qbaada tract (modern &lt;a href="Krasnaya%20Polyana%2C%20Sochi%2C%20Krasnodar%20Krai"&gt;Krasnaya Polyana&lt;/a&gt;) tanggal 2 Juni (21 Mei &lt;a href="Old%20Style"&gt;O.S.&lt;/a&gt;), 1864, kanthi manifesto [[Kaisar]] &lt;a href="Alexander%20II%20saka%20Rusia"&gt;Alexander&amp;nbsp;II&lt;/a&gt; diwaca kanthi banter dening &lt;a href="Adipati%20Agung%20Michael%20Nikolaevich%20saka%20Rusia"&gt;Adipati Agung Michael Nikolaevich saka Rusia&lt;/a&gt;.
