<doc id="187807" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=187807" title="IR Ishikawa Railway">
IR Ishikawa Railway

IR Ishikawa Railway (IRいしかわ鉄道株式会社, IR Ishikawa Tetsudō Kabushiki-gaisha) yaiku perusahaan sepur &lt;a href="Public-Private%20Partnerships%20In%20Japan"&gt;sektor katelu&lt;/a&gt; Jepang sing didegaké ing 2012 kanggo ngoperasikake layanan sepur penumpang ing bagean &lt;a href="Hokuriku%20Main%20Line"&gt;Jalur Utama Hokuriku&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="JR%20West"&gt;JR West&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Ishikawa"&gt;Prefektur Ishikawa&lt;/a&gt;. Jalur utama dipisahake saka jaringan JR West ing 14 Maret 2015, ngepasi karo mbukak sambungan &lt;a href="Hokuriku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Hokuriku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Nagano"&gt;Nagano&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kanazawa"&gt;Kanazawa&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iku didegaké ing 28 Agustus 2012 lan duwé kantor pusat ing &lt;a href="Kanazawa%2C%20Ishikawa"&gt;Kanazawa, Ishikawa&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Jalur IR Ishikawa Railway</h2>
<h3>Garis gedhe layanan</h3>
Jalur IR Ishikawa Railway.
Garis gedhe layanan.
Kabeh layanan antar dalan menyang lan saka &lt;a href="Ainokaze%20Toyama%20Railway%20Line"&gt;Jalur Ainokaze Toyama Railway&lt;/a&gt; (lan &lt;a href="Echigo%20Tokimeki%20Railway%20Nihonkai%20Hisui%20Line"&gt;Jalur Nihonkai Hisui Echigo Tokimeki Railway&lt;/a&gt;) ing sisih wétan utawa liwat &lt;a href="Nanao%20Line"&gt;Jalur Nanao&lt;/a&gt; JR West sing cawang ing &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tsubata"&gt;Tsubata&lt;/a&gt;. Layanan "Rapid" mandheg winates jenenge Ainokaze Liner (あいの風ライナー, Ainokaze Liner) sing dioperasikake antarane Kanazawa lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tomari%20%28Toyama%29"&gt;Tomari&lt;/a&gt; dening Ainokaze Toyama Railway sajrone puncak esuk lan sore, nanging iku ora ngawula stasiun IR Ishikawa Railway liyane saka Kanazawa. Layanan ekspres winates &lt;a href="Noto%20Kagaribi"&gt;Noto Kagaribi&lt;/a&gt; (Kanazawa - &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Wakura-Onsen"&gt;Wakura-Onsen&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Thunderbird%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Thunderbird&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt; - Wakura-Onsen) uga beroperasi ing bagean jalur antarane Kanazawa lan Tsubata, kanthi sawetara layanan nelpon ing Tsubata.
