<doc id="187961" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=187961" title="The Battle at Lake Changjin II">
The Battle at Lake Changjin II

The Battle at Lake Changjin II, uga diarani minangkas Water Gate Bridge, yaiku &lt;a href="filem%20perang"&gt;filem perang&lt;/a&gt; Tiongkok taun 2022 lan sekuel saka &lt;a href="The%20Battle%20at%20Lake%20Changjin"&gt;The Battle at Lake Changjin&lt;/a&gt; (2021). Filem kasebut disutradharani lan diprodhuseri dening &lt;a href="Chen%20Kaige"&gt;Chen Kaige&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tsui%20Hark"&gt;Tsui Hark&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Dante%20Lam"&gt;Dante Lam&lt;/a&gt; lan nampilke &lt;a href="Wu%20Jing%20%28pemeran%29"&gt;Wu Jing&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jackson%20Yee"&gt;Jackson Yee&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Duan%20Yihong"&gt;Duan Yihong&lt;/a&gt;. Filem kasebut mengeti &lt;a href="Peringatan%20Parte%20Komunis%20Tiongkok%20ping%20100"&gt;Peringatan Parte Komunis Tiongkok ping 100&lt;/a&gt; lan adhedhasar pertempuran bersejarah ing Perlintasan Funchilin ing &lt;a href="Pertempuran%20Rawa%20Chosin"&gt;Pertempuran Rawa Chosin&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Perang%20Korea"&gt;Perang Korea&lt;/a&gt;. 
Filem kasebut dirilis ing 1 Februari 2022 (&lt;a href="Taun%20Anyar%20Imlek"&gt;Taun Anyar Imlek&lt;/a&gt;). Filem kasebut entuk kauntungan cacahing $676 yuta ing Tiongkok ing pungkasan 17 April 2022.
