Kabiskopan Agung Lima

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
&lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biskop%20metropolitan"&gt;Metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; Lima (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Limana) yaiku bagean saka Greja Katulik Roma ing Peru sing gumantung marang &lt;a href="Tahta%20Suci"&gt;Tahta Suci&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan Agung kasebut didegake minangka Kabiskopan Lima ing 14 Mei 1541. Kabiskopan kasebut dimunggahke dadi kabiskopan agung metropolitan dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Paulus%20III"&gt;Paus Paulus III&lt;/a&gt; ing 12 Februari 1546. Salah sijining biskop agunge menika santo &lt;a href="Torribio%20Mogrovejo"&gt;Torribio Mogrovejo&lt;/a&gt;.
Kabiskopan-kabiskopan &lt;a href="suffragan"&gt;suffragan&lt;/a&gt;e menika: &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Callao"&gt;Callao&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Carabayllo"&gt;Carabayllo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Chosica"&gt;Chosica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Huacho"&gt;Huacho&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Ica"&gt;Ica&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Lurin"&gt;Lurin&lt;/a&gt;. Sawise 25 Januari 2019, Biskop Agung Lima dijabat dening &lt;a href="Carlos%20Castillo%20Mattasoglio"&gt;Carlos Castillo Mattasoglio&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Istana%20Biskop%20Agung%20Lima"&gt;Istana Biskop Agung Lima&lt;/a&gt; menika markas gedhe kabiskopan agung kasebut.
