<doc id="188455" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=188455" title="Aoimori Railway Line">
Aoimori Railway Line

Aoimori Railway Line (青い森鉄道線, Aoimori Tetsudō-sen) yaiku &lt;a href="rel%20regional"&gt;jalur sepur regional&lt;/a&gt; ing Prefektur Aomori, Jepang sing dioperasèkaké déning &lt;a href="Aoimori%20Railway%20Company"&gt;Aoimori Railway Company&lt;/a&gt;. Iku nyambungake stasiun terminal &lt;a href="Iwate%20Galaxy%20Railway%20Line"&gt;Jalur Iwate Galaxy Railway&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Metoki"&gt;Stasiun Metoki&lt;/a&gt;, ing kutha &lt;a href="Sannohe%2C%20Aomori"&gt;Sannohe&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Aomori"&gt;Stasiun Aomori&lt;/a&gt;, pungkasan sawetara jalur sepur ing kutha &lt;a href="Aomori"&gt;Aomori&lt;/a&gt;. Jalur Aoimori lan Iwate Galaxy Railway minangka tilas bagean saka &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dhoku%20Main%20Line"&gt;Jalur Utama Tōhoku&lt;/a&gt; sing nyambungake &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; menyang Aomori sing wis ora bisa digunakake kanggo layanan penumpang jarak adoh amarga rampunge &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dhoku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōhoku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; ing antarane stasiun &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Aomori"&gt;Shin-Aomori&lt;/a&gt;. Senajan layanan penumpang lokal ditindakake ing jalur kasebut dening Aoimori Railway Company, &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;East Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; tetep ngoperasikake layanan sing winates, kayata sepur wisata &lt;a href="Resort%20Asunaro"&gt;Resort Asunaro&lt;/a&gt;, ing sadawane jalur kasebut, lan &lt;a href="Japan%20Freight%20Railway%20Company"&gt;Japan Freight Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; ngangkut barang ing jalur kasebut.
