<doc id="188620" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=188620" title="Tokyo Monorail">
Tokyo Monorail

Tokyo Monorail (東京モノレール, Tōkyō Monorēru), resmipun Jalur Tokyo Monorail Haneda Airport (東京モノレール羽田空港線, Tōkyō Monorēru Haneda Kūkō sen), yaiku jalur &lt;a href="monorel"&gt;monorel&lt;/a&gt; straddle-beam tipe &lt;a href="Alweg"&gt;Alweg&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang. Iku minangka &lt;a href="jalur%20sepur%20bandara"&gt;jalur sepur bandara&lt;/a&gt; sing nyambungake &lt;a href="Haneda%20Airport"&gt;Tokyo Internasional Airport&lt;/a&gt; (Haneda) menyang &lt;a href="Distrik%20Kutha%20Khusus%20Tokyo"&gt;Distrik Kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%C5%8Cta%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Ōta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shinagawa"&gt;Shinagawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Minato%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Minato&lt;/a&gt; Tokyo. Jalur 17.8 km nglayani 11 stasiun antara Stasiun &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Hamamatsuch%C5%8D"&gt;Monorail Hamamatsuchō&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Terminal%202%20Haneda%20Airport"&gt;Terminal 2 Haneda Airport&lt;/a&gt;. Iku lumaku ing rute lor-kidul sing umume ing dhuwur ing pesisir kulon &lt;a href="Teluk%20Tokyo"&gt;Teluk Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;. Monorail iku dioperasikake dening Tokyo Monorail Co., Ltd., sing diduweni bebarengan karo &lt;a href="JR%20East"&gt;JR East&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Rute</h2>
Rute.
Tokyo Monorail duwe dawa 17.8 km lan ngliwati &lt;a href="Distrik%20Kutha%20Khusus%20Tokyo"&gt;Distrik Kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Minato%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Minato&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shinagawa"&gt;Shinagawa&lt;/a&gt; lan Ōta ing Tokyo. Saka terminal sisih lor ing Stasiun Monorail Hamamatsuchō, jalur kasebut menyang kidul nalika ngliwati Yamanote, Keihin–Tōhoku, &lt;a href="Ueno%E2%80%93Tokyo%20Line"&gt;Ueno–Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dkaid%C5%8D%20Main%20Line"&gt;Jalur Utama Tōkaidō&lt;/a&gt; lan Tokaido Shinkansen. Nalika lumebu ing &lt;a href="Shibaura"&gt;Shibaura&lt;/a&gt;, dheweke ngetutake pinggir kanal sing diubengi pulo buatan. Ing sawijining pulo buatan ing #ALIH ing sisih wétan Stasiun Shinagawa lan kampus utama &lt;a href="Universitas%20Sains%20dan%20Teknologi%20Kelautan%20Tokyo"&gt;Universitas Sains dan Teknologi Kelautan Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, monorail wiwit ngetutake jalur &lt;a href="Shuto%20Expressway"&gt;Shuto Expressway&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Haneda%20Route"&gt;Rute Haneda&lt;/a&gt; kanthi mandheg ing Pulo Tennōzu.
