<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Kabiskopan Agung Zagreb (#ALIH, &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidioecesis Zagrebiensis) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan%20agung"&gt;kabiskopan agung&lt;/a&gt; pusat &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20ing%20Kroasia"&gt;Greja Katulik ing Kroasia&lt;/a&gt;, sing berpusat ing ibu kutha &lt;a href="Zagreb"&gt;Zagreb&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan agung kasebut menika &lt;a href="tahta%20metropolitan"&gt;tahta metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; Kroasia, lan biskop saikine menika &lt;a href="Josip%20Bozani%C4%87"&gt;Josip Bozanić&lt;/a&gt;.
